==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], it was called Black Cyclone.
**Since [[Attack on D-Cyclone (Expert)|Attack on B-Cyclone]], [[Wrath of D-Cyclone (Insane)|Wrath of B-Cyclone]] and [[Revenge of D-Cyclone (Deadly)|Revenge of B-Cyclone]] weren't changed accordingly until [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], they still referenced its original name until then.
*Dark Cyclone is one of the few [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] whose eyes are not red.
**It is also the only Dark enemy to have a blue eye.
*Dark Cyclone is usually treated as the second [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]], coming before [[White Cyclone]], yet in the [[Enemy Release Order]] they are reversed.
*Dark Cyclone has the fastest attack rate of all Dark enemies and is tied with [[Metal Cyclone]] for the highest knockback count of all Cyclones.
*Prior to the [[Enemy Guide]] rework in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]], Dark Cyclone and [[Bun Bun Black]]'s traits in the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]] were listed as [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] rather than Floating/Dark.

